        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/f05b48/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-09-17T13:59:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"ketigid\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> ketigid:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Maybe the same base heroes from another time line, so we will have Yellow Legacy, Pink Tachyon, Purple Bunker, etc. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Is this the <em>Rainbow Bright and the Color Kids</em> timeline?</p>",
